    <string name="assistant_chat_consent_failed">Your answer could not be stored. Save again to be asked again.</string>
    <string name="assistant_privacy">Nothing is sent until you tap a button such as Summarize or send a message in the chat. A button sends the mail you chose to the service above, and nothing else. In the chat, the assistant itself chooses which mail, folders and calendar entries it reads to answer you, and those go to the same service. The assistant never sends or deletes mail, and it changes nothing unless you approve exactly that change.</string>
