    <string name="assistant_reset_text">This puts every setting of the assistant for this account back to its default and switches it off. It also removes the stored keys and takes back every agreement you gave, for both services, the chat included. You will have to enter a key and agree again to use it. It cannot be done while the assistant is working.</string>
